CHAPTER.VERS:
Come near, you

          {+}
         nations, to hear; and listen, you

          {+}
         peoples: let the earth hear, and the fullness of it; the world, and all things that come forth from it.

Seek

          {+}
         out of the Book of Yahweh, and read: no one of these will be missing, none will want her mate; for my mouth, it has commanded, and his Spirit, it has gathered them.
